<title>USA: North Coast Energy extends conversion offer.</title>
<headline>North Coast Energy extends conversion offer.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Coast Energy Inc said on Friday it is extending by a month its conversion offer for holders of its Series A 6 percent convertible preferred stock and Series B cumulative convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>The offer, which had been due to expire Friday, was extended to February 28.</p>
